{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばちは\n \n 最近ラジオで初めてメールを読まれました！！\n とっても嬉しかったし、\n この気持ちを誰かに伝えたくて\n 家を飛び出しそうになりました☺️☺️\n \n ハガキ職人さんの気持ちがわかりました！\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NDPMKSEN3G6TFKPKX3HD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 貰いました！嬉しい〜〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NEXHETTWDQ7X4X8VDZTH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n としちゃんお疲れ様〜\n \n \n 昨日は「うたコン」に\n 出演させていただきました！\n なんと、私は小さい時からずっと聞いてた\n 美川憲一さんの「さそり座の女」にも\n 出させていただきました！\n \n 小さいとき兄と父とよく歌っていたのです。\n \n 不思議だ〜〜素敵だ〜〜\n と噛み締めながら、踊らせていただきました！\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n \n そして、\n 先日から日向坂46の1stシングルの\n 個別握手会が始まりました〜\n 「キュン」がずっと流れていて、\n キュンキュンしちゃいましたね😶（笑）\n \n \n 🐡1・2部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NG409XVVC2MRJ2GXZP79","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n トップス：ユニクロ\n スカート：merry jenny\n 靴：Dr.Martens\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NH5EY4HX5J3Y3HPA7XEF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 欅さんの3周年ステッカー貼りました💗\n \n \n 🐡3・4部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NJ6KG6CD7Z1JE15A95Q7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n タピオカ持つ女\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NK8MAVG18APYSANZ73CK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 非常口を案内する女\n \n ベスト：OHOTORO\n シャツワンピース：メチャカリ\n \n \n \n この日私が憧れてるアイドルの方の\n メークを真似したんです！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NMCPMYE3BKEPHQEYMXPC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n エチュードハウスの\n アイシャドウパレットを使いました！\n 全色使えるのでとってもおススメですよ😚\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NP050F8DV29QS0Q6SKBX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NQ1E2Y1VZ44WB92BJRR8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NR3M7Z4PS96VHGX4QTXW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NS7AG4QXNKEK3HRESJX3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NTATYAQZ8S4TDAZX6BMW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NVDW63RZ889YF4AJQK22","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n お花もこんなにたくさん！\n ありがとうございました😭\n \n \n \n お知らせです！\n 発売中の「BOMB」さんに\n 載せていただいてます！\n 是非チェックしてください💗\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22NWNFS38F2MCA5A9YPCXZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}